B.agu=s(["Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng b\xe1n, cho thu\xea, trao \u0111\u1ed5i hay mua b\xe1n d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n d\u01b0\u1edbi b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 h\xecnh th\u1ee9c n\xe0o \u2014 h\xe0nh vi mua b\xe1n d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\xe1 nh\xe2n b\u1ecb nghi\xeam c\u1ea5m theo Lu\u1eadt 91/2025/QH15.","Pandlish kh\xf4ng t\xedch h\u1ee3p c\xf4ng c\u1ee5 ph\xe2n t\xedch hay c\xf4ng c\u1ee5 theo d\xf5i c\u1ee7a b\xean th\u1ee9 ba. SDK qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o duy nh\u1ea5t l\xe0 Google AdMob, ch\u1ec9 ch\u1ea1y cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi ch\u01b0a c\xf3 g\xf3i h\u1ed9i vi\xean.","Theo CCPA / CPRA, ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng \u201cb\xe1n\u201d (sell) th\xf4ng tin c\xe1 nh\xe2n. Qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\xe1 qua Google AdMob c\xf3 th\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c coi l\xe0 \u201cchia s\u1ebb\u201d (share); b\u1ea1n c\xf3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i b\u1eb1ng c\xe1ch t\u1eaft qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o c\xe1 nh\xe2n ho\xe1 / xo\xe1 m\xe3 qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o trong c\xe0i \u0111\u1eb7t thi\u1ebft b\u1ecb, ho\u1eb7c d\xf9ng m\u1ed9t g\xf3i h\u1ed9i vi\xean (kh\xf4ng c\xf3 qu\u1ea3ng c\xe1o).","Ch\xfang m\xecnh kh\xf4ng d\xf9ng d\u1eef li\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u1ec3 ra quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh ho\xe0n to\xe0n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng g\xe2y \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng ph\xe1p l\xfd ho\u1eb7c \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\xe1ng k\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ebfn b\u1ea1n."],t.s)
